  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "智代子……『W.I.N.G.』のことなんだが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001080010,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "私、落ちちゃったんですね",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000108/7010001080010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ああ、残念だけど……\r\nって、どうしてわかったんだ？",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001080020,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "顔見ればわかっちゃいますよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000108/7010001080020"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001080030,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……ごめんなさい、\r\nあんなに大きなイベントにも連れて行ってもらったのに",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000108/7010001080030"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001080040,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんの期待にも、\r\nファンのみんなの期待にも、応えられませんでした……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000108/7010001080040"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001080050,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……それでも私、これで終わりにしたくないんです",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000108/7010001080050"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001080060,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "だから……\r\nもう一度、私をプロデュースしてくれませんか",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
